@startuml
title Figure 6 — UML Activity diagram — authenticated customer review
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}

|Customer Care Operator|
start
:Enter credentials;

|React operator UI|
:Submit login;

|Security / HTTP adapter|
if (Credentials valid?) then (no)
  :Reject protected request;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display authentication required;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Establish OperatorId context;
endif

|Customer Care Operator|
:Enter Customer ID;

|React operator UI|
:Request customer review;

|Security / HTTP adapter|
:Authorize protected GET;

|Customer / Risk application|
:Load CustomerSnapshot\nthrough CustomerActivityPort;

|Activity adapter|
if (R1 synthetic profile?) then (yes)
  :Load deterministic synthetic\nactivity and risk evidence;
else (R2+ relational profile)
  :Read source relations through JPA;
  :Map source rows to\nActivityProjection and RiskEvidence;
endif

|Customer / Risk application|
if (Customer exists?) then (no)
  :Return not-found outcome;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display unknown customer;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Return CustomerSnapshot;
endif

|React operator UI|
:Render CARD, PAYMENT, CRYPTO\nactivity and risk evidence;

|Customer Care Operator|
:Review customer activity;
stop
@enduml
